<title>UK: Burmah shares fall as Cazenove downgrades.</title>
<headline>Burmah shares fall as Cazenove downgrades.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Burmah Castrol fell on Monday amid talk that analysts as Cazenove had downgraded profit forecasts for the company.</p>
<p>The shares were off 29p at 10.37-1/2 stg by 1029 GMT.</p>
<p>Market sources said the brokerage had reduced earnings forecasts on currency factors.</p>
<p>A spokeman for Cazenove confirmed they had downgraded the stock but declined to give any details.</p>
<p>--Elaine Hardcastle, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
